WEBVTT

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.136
This heat is hard to bear

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.816
If we don't move,
then the sea's gonna dry

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.936
All the walls of the town are gonna crack

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.136
Some of us are stuck on chairs

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.296
Welding to them, they're gonna die

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:11.376
All these trees begging for some water

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.496
What can stop it now?

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.656
Find this truck, baby, I'm gonna drive

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.616
What can stop it?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.976
Téh téh téh téh téh téh

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.176
What can stop it now?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.096
Téh téh téh téh téh téh

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.816
What can stop it now?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.896
So let's get a pumper

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.016
Drop the water from above